# shots_tutorial.pdl - the user tutorial of the whole rmmc UI and every feature, played as a HUMAN: real X keys into the editor window (nav numbers typed then Return for a hotbar slot, as the house bars are driven), window captures so the bars are in the picture.
# Hotbar keys (In: on, play mode): 1..9 pick that slot of the current page, 0 flips the page. Page 1: dirt 1 stone 2 sand 3 snow 4 log 5 leaves 6 gravel 7 pickaxe 8 axe 9; page 2: shovel 1 shears 2 sandstone 3 planks 4 table 5.
SETUP | spawn 142 100
SEAT | human
SHOT | t01-tour     | human | xkey:1 | asa 7 165 -10  | 2 | 300 | The window: menus on top, the Pals sidebar left, the island in the middle, chat right, the hotbar along the bottom | window
SHOT | t02-walk1    | human | xkey:Right                  | asa 5 165 -12 | 2 | 250 | Arrow keys walk Asa one cell | window
SHOT | t03-walk2    | human | xkey:Right                  | asa 5 165 -12 | 2 | 250 | Press again: another step east | window
SHOT | t04-jump     | human | xkey:space                  | asa 5 165 -12 | 2 | 250 | Space jumps | window
SHOT | t05-place1   | human | xkey:g                      | asa 5 165 -12 | 2 | 250 | G places the picked block (dirt) in front of him | window
SHOT | t06-place2   | human | xkey:g                      | asa 5 165 -12 | 2 | 250 | Place another on top | window
SHOT | t07-swing1   | human | xkey:b                      | asa 5 165 -12 | 2 | 250 | B mines. The first swing only cracks the block | window
SHOT | t08-break    | human | xkey:b                      | asa 5 165 -12 | 3 | 250 | The second swing breaks it: the pillar is lower and the block drops, then flies into the bag. See the count on the hotbar | window
SHOT | t09-log      | human | xkey:5 g           | asa 5 165 -12 | 2 | 250 | Number keys pick a hotbar slot: 5 is the log. G places it | window
SHOT | t10-axe      | human | xkey:9 b           | asa 5 165 -12 | 2 | 250 | Pick the axe (9) and swing: trees need an axe | window
SHOT | t11-axe-break| human | xkey:b                      | asa 5 165 -12 | 3 | 250 | The log breaks and drops | window
SHOT | t12-flip     | human | xkey:0             | asa 5 165 -12 | 2 | 300 | The hotbar has pages: the 0 key flips to the next one | window
SHOT | t13-planks   | human | xkey:4 c           | asa 5 165 -12 | 2 | 250 | Pick planks and press C to craft: one log makes four planks | window
SHOT | t14-table    | human | xkey:5 c           | asa 5 165 -12 | 2 | 250 | Pick the crafting table and press C: four planks make a table | window
SHOT | t15-place-tbl| human | xkey:g                      | asa 5 165 -12 | 2 | 250 | G places the table | window
SHOT | t16-log2     | human | xkey:0 5 g | asa 5 165 -12 | 2 | 250 | Back to page one: another log | window
SHOT | t17-axe2     | human | xkey:9 b b         | asa 5 165 -12 | 3 | 250 | Two swings with the axe | window
SHOT | t18-planks2  | human | xkey:0 4 c | asa 5 165 -12 | 2 | 250 | Craft the planks again | window
SHOT | t19-pickaxe  | human | xkey:0 8 c | asa 5 165 -12 | 2 | 250 | With the table beside him, pick the pickaxe (8) and press C to craft it | window
SHOT | t20-stone    | human | xkey:2 g           | asa 5 165 -12 | 2 | 250 | Place a stone block | window
SHOT | t21-hand     | human | xkey:b                      | asa 5 165 -12 | 2 | 250 | By hand, stone will not break: the sidebar says so | window
SHOT | t22-pick     | human | xkey:8 b           | asa 5 165 -12 | 2 | 250 | With the pickaxe picked, the same key cracks it | window
SHOT | t23-stone-brk| human | xkey:b                      | asa 5 165 -12 | 3 | 250 | And breaks it | window
SHOT | t24-outro    | human | none                        | asa 7 165 -10  | 3 | 400 | Walk, jump, place, mine, craft: all from the keyboard | window
